+# Neo Quiz: the stock template runs SILENT, so nothing is on screen while the
+# whole Electron tree (~300 MB) is decompressed to TEMP. On a slow disk that is
+# tens of seconds during which the user believes nothing happened. A single
+# native progress page appears at once instead, and is hidden as soon as the
+# extracted application takes over.
+Caption "${PRODUCT_NAME}"
+SubCaption 3 " "
+ChangeUI all "${NSISDIR}\Contrib\UIs\sdbarker_tiny.exe"
+InstProgressFlags smooth
+XPStyle on
+Page instfiles
 
+Function .onInit
   !insertmacro check64BitAndSetRegView
 FunctionEnd
 
 Function .onGUIInit
